This product is an unofficial Rust port of the parts of Apache Avro 1.12.2 (https://avro.apache.org/,
https://github.com/apache/avro) that a JSON-to-binary codec reaches: the schema parser, JsonDecoder and JsonEncoder and
the binary encoding. Apache Avro is Copyright The Apache Software Foundation and licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The ported behaviour, exception texts and the test inputs taken from it remain under that license;
`upstream/` pins the ported release as a submodule, with its own LICENSE.txt and NOTICE.txt.

This product includes software developed at The Apache Software Foundation (https://www.apache.org/).

The expected outputs under tests/vectors/ were recorded from the real Apache Avro 1.12.2 Java library (Apache-2.0) by
scripts/record.sh. "Apache", "Apache Avro" and the Apache feather are trademarks of the Apache Software Foundation;
this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by it.
